    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow or contact us</h2>Bilibili: \u987d\u56fa\u4e0d\u7720Dev\uff1b<br>QQ\u7fa4\uff1a926177967\uff1b<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:2294508700@qq.com;\">2294508700@qq.com;</a><br>Twitter: GuoGameDev;<br>Discord: ;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2>\u60b2\u54c0\u670b\u514b\uff1a\u52b3\u52a8\u3001\u751f\u5b58\u4e0e\u706b\u7bad TRAGEDYPUNK:LABOR, SURVIVAL AND ROCKET <br>This is a plot oriented pixel style visual novel+barrage attack game.<br><br>Our story takes place in Pioneer City, a fictional city in the near future. In this era, rocket technology based on Hall thrusters has achieved breakthroughs, and Pioneer City's pillar industry is manufacturing and launching rockets.<br><br>In the game, you will embark on a life adventure in Pioneer City from the perspective of the protagonist Hoy.<br>You will face multiple challenges from job seeking, work, and life. Through a series of plot choices and interactive game tests, the fate of the protagonist and NPC will be determined.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In This Game What You Will Experience</h2><br><i><strong>Exciting plot</strong></i>\uff1aAlthough games are not reality, we still hope that you can control the fate of the game protagonist and lead him out of difficulties.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/6e5d7d65ad735c877176e1c74a4b8e54.poster.avif?t=1721445992\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/6e5d7d65ad735c877176e1c74a4b8e54.webm?t=1721445992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/6e5d7d65ad735c877176e1c74a4b8e54.mp4?t=1721445992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>Cyber Job Application And Cyber Interview Simulator</strong></i>\uff1aDo you like this company? Left swipe to deliver, right swipe to delete, just like a dating app.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/afa5a1f44ceab78d1425910166e982cd.poster.avif?t=1721445992\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/afa5a1f44ceab78d1425910166e982cd.webm?t=1721445992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/afa5a1f44ceab78d1425910166e982cd.mp4?t=1721445992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>Interviewing</strong></i>\uff1aIn Pioneer City in the near future, interviews have fully shifted to online.<br><br>Your interviewer will be appointed by the artificial intelligence of the other company. Please be cautious, these guys are not easy to deal with.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/12388ebba074f788a570087f3455c4f3.poster.avif?t=1721445992\" width=620 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/12388ebba074f788a570087f3455c4f3.webm?t=1721445992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/12388ebba074f788a570087f3455c4f3.mp4?t=1721445992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i><strong>Rich battles</strong></i>\uff1aMore exciting battles await you to unlock!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2769530/extras/76ab067b1f14d5ac5ec3fb997e754f54.poster.avif?t=1721445992\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"ht